{"id":"298d80fabfd2a708","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-pr-predicate.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Predicate (Relation)","display":"df-pr-predicate — Primitive Recursive Predicate (Relation)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-pr-predicate","aliases":["92-df-pr-predicate"],"display":"df-pr-predicate — Primitive Recursive Predicate (Relation)","depends_on":["[[92-df-pr-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-pr-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-pr-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pr-predicate — Primitive Recursive Predicate (Relation)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^k\">\\(R \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^k\\)</span> (arity and relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> (definition target primitive-recursive predicate class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R\">\\(\\chi_R\\)</span> (characteristic function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\chi_R:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\bigl(\\chi_R(\\vec n)=1\\leftrightarrow\\vec n\\in R\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRPred}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\chi_R\\in\\mathrm{PR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\chi_R:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\bigl(\\chi_R(\\vec n)=1\\leftrightarrow\\vec n\\in R\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRPred}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\chi_R\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PR谓词：特征函数是原始递归的关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R\">\\(\\chi_R\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>的特征函数</li>\n<li>PR谓词封闭于布尔运算（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land, \\lor, \\neg\">\\(\\land, \\lor, \\neg\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>PR谓词封闭于有界量词</li>\n<li>在本书固定的有效编码下，公式码、证明码和系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的公理码关系可分别证明为 PR；这些是应用定理，不是本定义的无条件例子</li>\n<li>PR 谓词在 PA 中的表示需要调用相应的可表示性定理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive recursive functions, see [[92-df-pr-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\chi_R:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\bigl(\\chi_R(\\vec n)=1\\leftrightarrow\\vec n\\in R\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRPred}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\chi_R\\in\\mathrm{PR}","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\land, \\lor, \\neg","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[{"id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c4da698d5dde6a6d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}$ (primitive-recursive relation predicate, see [[92-df-pr-predicate]])"},{"id":"bf315ef87cd91c88","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}$ (primitive-recursive relation predicate, see [[92-df-pr-predicate]])"},{"id":"9fd00b865071e121","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-networ